### 3. Telegram Integration & Batching / Retry Queue

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/integration/telegram_client.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/integration/telegram_client.go)
- Client HTTP berbasis `net/http` yang mengirim pesan ke Telegram Bot API (`https://api.telegram.org/bot<token>/sendMessage`).
- Rate limiting internal: batas maksimal 30 pesan per menit.
- Graceful error handling saat token kosong atau network timeout.

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/service/telegram_service.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/service/telegram_service.go)
- Formatter pesan Markdown standar tanpa emoji:
  ```text
  [CRITICAL] ContainerOOMKilled
  Resource: payment-gateway (Docker)
  Time: 2026-09-06 15:30:00 UTC
  Description: Container killed due to OOM
  Action Required: Acknowledge in dashboard
  ```
- **Alert Batching**: Jendela deteksi 2 menit berbasis Redis. Jika > 3 alert masuk dalam jendela waktu tersebut, pesan individual ditahan dan digantikan oleh pesan ringkasan (`[SUMMARY] N Alerts Detected`).
- **Redis Retry Queue**: Jika pengiriman ke Telegram gagal, pesan dimasukkan ke antrean Redis `cifo:telegram:retry_queue` dan diproses ulang oleh worker.

