### 4. Notification Service, Incident Service & Escalation

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/service/notification_service.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/service/notification_service.go)
- Interface `NotificationService`:
  - `Notify(ctx, incident, isEscalation)`:
    - Memicu pengiriman pesan Telegram via `TelegramService` (asinkron).
    - Mem-broadcast in-app alert via `wsHub.Broadcast(ws.TopicNotifications, ...)` untuk toast real-time di frontend.
